1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
It's so humid today, isn't it?

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:06,350
I know, I can barely breathe out there. Did you check the forecast?

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,500
Yeah, it said there might be a thunderstorm later.

4
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,130
Oh, really? Then I should probably leave work early.

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,840
That sounds smart. You don't want to get stuck in the rain.

6
00:00:17,189 --> 00:00:20,749
Exactly. I'll head out before it starts pouring.
